{"arm": "X2-F", "compounds": 0, "compounds_kept": 0, "diagnoses": [{"cell": 3, "cost_per_unit": "About 21.7 microseconds cumulative per top-level statement under the profiler (1.11 s / 51200). Each statement costs roughly 10 skip_chars calls (502400 / 51200) and a five-frame chain (key_value_rule, parse_key_value_pair, parse_key, parse_key_part, skip_chars) before the value is read.", "deal_round": 1, "doubling": "Linear. Doubling the document doubles calls and time; no superlinear term appears at this key depth.", "gap": "Most time is Python call and bookkeeping overhead, not character work. Most skip_chars calls skip zero or one character. skip_comments_and_array_ws takes up to two iterations and four calls to conclude no comment is present. The header's table is re-resolved from the root for every statement. A bare", "least_work": "Read each source character once, build one Python object per value, do one duplicate check and one dict insert per key, and resolve the target table once per section header.", "library": "tomli", "run": 1, "unit_count": "Over 8 parses: 51200 key_value_rule calls (6400 per parse), 60800 parse_key_value_pair, 67200 parse_key, 108800 parse_value, 115200 skip_comments_and_array_ws and 502400 skip_chars calls.", "unit_of_work": "One key/value statement (key, equals sign, value) in the main loads loop, plus the values and separators nested inside arrays and inline tables."}], "experiment": "ideas-x2-round", "kept": 2, "lane_views": [{"lane": "obvious", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "view_sha": "89fddb32"}, {"lane": "recombine", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "view_sha": "89fddb32"}, {"lane": "assume_less", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "view_sha": "89fddb32"}, {"lane": "leap", "served_model": "claude-fable-5-2", "view_sha": "89fddb32"}, {"lane": "eliminate", "served_model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "view_sha": "89fddb32"}, {"lane": "name_the_problem", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "view_sha": "89fddb32"}, {"lane": "reso